### Unified Authentication Flow
```
1. User clicks any "Sign In" or "Sign Up" CTA
   ↓
2. Redirects to gvteway.one/auth
   ↓
3. Single authentication page with:
   - Email/Password
   - Social login (Google, Apple, Spotify)
   - Magic link option
   ↓
4. After successful authentication:
   IF first-time user → App selection screen
   IF returning user → Redirect to last used app or selection screen
   ↓
5. App Selection Screen shows:
   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │  WELCOME BACK, [USER]                   │
   │  Choose your experience:                │
   │                                         │
   │  [GVTEWAY]                             │
   │  Discover & attend events               │
   │  → app.gvteway.one                     │
   │                                         │
   │  [ATLVS]                               │
   │  Create & manage experiences            │
   │  → atlvs.gvteway.one                   │
   │                                         │
   │  [COMPVSS]                             │
   │  Collaborate on productions             │
   │  → compvss.gvteway.one                 │
   │                                         │
   │  [Remember my choice]                   │
   └─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### SSO Implementation
- Single authentication service across all domains
- JWT tokens valid across all subdomains
- Role-based permissions stored in user profile
- Seamless switching between apps without re-authentication

