## GHXSTSHIP Design System

### Typography Hierarchy
```css
/* TITLES & MAIN HEADLINES */
.title, .hero-title {
  font-family: 'ANTON', sans-serif;
  /* Large, impactful statements */
}

/* PRIMARY HEADERS */
h1 {
  font-family: 'ANTON', sans-serif;
  /* Page titles, hero headlines */
}

/* SECONDARY HEADERS */
h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: 'BEBAS NEUE', sans-serif;
  /* Section headers, card titles, navigation */
}

/* BODY TEXT */
body, p, .body-text {
  font-family: 'Share Tech', sans-serif;
  /* Descriptions, paragraphs, general content */
}

/* MONOSPACE */
.mono, code, pre, .technical {
  font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
  /* Technical specs, pricing, timestamps, data */
}

/* SUBTITLES & METADATA */
.subtitle, .caption, .metadata {
  font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
  /* Event details, venue info, dates, supporting text */
}
```

